legend.SelectionTool.Page3.Title = Selection Commands
legend.SelectionTool.Page3.BasicCommands = Basic Commands:\n\
- /set [Sets selection to blocks]\n\
- /clear [Clears all blocks in the selection]\n\
- /walls [Adds walls to selection]\n\
- /move [Moves the contents of the selection the direction you're facing]\n\
- /undo and /redo [Undo and Redo X times]\n\
- /copy [Copies the selection to clipboard]\n\
- /cut [Cuts the selection to clipboard]\n\
- /paste [Pastes clipboard at your position]\n\
- /stack [Stacks the selection in the direction you're facing X times]\n\
- /replace [Replace one material with another]\n\
- /hollow [Hollows out a shape leaving the center empty]\n\
- /flip [Mirror the blocks in the direction you're looking]\n\
- /rotate [Rotate the selection]\n\
- /expand [Expand the selection in the direction you're looking]\n\
- /contract [Shrink the selection by a distance]\n\
- /deselect [Clear the selection box]
legend.SelectionTool.Page3.SeeHelpMenu = See the '/help' menu for more commands you can run on your selection!
legend.RulerTool.Page1.Title = Basic Measurements
legend.RulerTool.Page1.Description = The Ruler Tool allows you to measure distances between multiple points in 3D space, with support for multiple measurement lines.
legend.RulerTool.Page1.PlacePoint = Place a measurement point at your target location
legend.RulerTool.Page1.EndCurrentLine = End the current measurement line and start a new one
legend.RulerTool.Page1.SnapToAngles = Hold to enable snapping to 45° angles for precise measurements
legend.RulerTool.Page1.DistanceMeasurement = Distance measurements are displayed at each point and along each line segment. Lines are color-coded: Red (X-axis), Green (Y-axis), Blue (Z-axis), White (diagonal)
legend.RulerTool.Page2.Title = Editing Points & Lines
legend.RulerTool.Page2.PointEditing = Editing existing points:
legend.RulerTool.Page2.MovePoint = Right-click on an existing point to pick it up and move it
legend.RulerTool.Page2.DropPoint = Right-click again to drop the point at the new location
legend.RulerTool.Page2.DeletePoint = Delete the hovered point
legend.RulerTool.Page2.ClearCurrentLine = Clear all points from the current line
legend.RulerTool.Page2.ClearAllLines = Clear all lines and reset the tool
legend.RulerTool.Page3.Title = Multiple Measurement Lines
legend.RulerTool.Page3.Description = The Ruler Tool supports creating and managing multiple separate measurement lines. Each line is tracked independently and can be edited separately.
