legend.RulerTool.Page3.WorkflowTip = Tip: After placing points on one line, left-click to finish it and automatically start a new line. Inactive lines are displayed with reduced opacity.
legend.SelectPrefabTool.Page1.Title = Prefab Selector
legend.SelectPrefabTool.Page1.Description = The prefab editor creates a temporary environment for editing prefabs and saving them again. If you leave the prefab editor without saving, your changes will be lost.
